<title>JAPAN: Nippon Credit bid-only in Tokyo morning.</title>
<headline>Nippon Credit bid-only in Tokyo morning.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nippon Credit Bank Ltd were bid-only in early morning trade on Thursday, a day after the bank denied recent market rumours about its financial health, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0010 GMT, the bank shares were bid at 186 yen, compared with their record-low close of 181 yen on Wednesday.</p>
